title: "PBH: codes for primordial black hole formation in an early matter era"
abstract: "Einstein–Vlasov codes for primordial black hole formation before reheating: a spherical solver in the areal–CMC gauge (pbhgr), exact LTB and peak profiles, a Newtonian 3D particle-mesh code, the 3D GR particle module PBHVlasov for GRTeclyn, the GRChombo example PBHCosmo, and sphdiag, diagnostics of spherical 3+1 slices."
